        }
      }
    },
    "Draw the selected objects into the layer's pixels: they are no longer editable as shapes or text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将所选对象绘入图层的像素：之后不能再作为形状或文字编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop LoRA, DiT or VAE weights on this panel: .safetensors files or folders." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将 LoRA、DiT 或 VAE 权重拖放到此面板：.safetensors 文件或文件夹均可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop a picture or a clip on a layer to show it there; clips start with the timeline. Each layer's adjustments, crop and turn are keyed on the clip's timeline: select a layer, then set its keys." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "把图片或视频拖到图层上，就在该图层上显示；视频从时间线开头播放。每个图层的调整、裁剪和旋转都在视频的时间线上设置关键帧：先选中图层，再设置它的关键帧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop an asset on the stage to put it on a new layer at the playhead, or on a layer's row to show it there. Trim sets where the selected layer starts and what of it shows; its adjustments, crop and turn are keyed from its start. A layer showing a composition decomposes from its menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将素材拖到舞台上，即可在播放头位置放到新图层上；拖到图层行上则由该图层显示它。修剪面板设置所选图层的起点和显示的范围；它的调整、裁剪和旋转从其起点开始设置关键帧。显示合成的图层可从其菜单中分解。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop files on the prompt box" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将文件拖到提示框上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop in pictures, clips and sounds, and name them <Picture 1>, <Video 1>, <Audio 1>" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "拖入图片、片段和声音，并以 <Picture 1>、<Video 1>、<Audio 1> 指称它们"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "持续时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamic int8 for the block's large matrix products, at int8 quality. Needs the M5's matrix cores." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "块内大矩阵乘法使用动态 int8，精度为 int8。需要 M5 的矩阵核心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EXIF" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "EXIF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each frame of the timeline shows the clip's frame at that moment: frames repeat or are skipped. (Rendering new frames in between is to come.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "时间线的每一帧显示片段在那一刻的帧：帧会重复或被跳过。（在两帧之间渲染新帧将在以后提供。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each page shows the layers on it; a new layer, or an asset dropped on the stage, goes on the page shown — a layer's menu sets its pages. Adjustments, crop and turn are keyed by page, as a clip's by frame. Export writes a file a page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每一页显示其上的图层；新图层或拖到舞台上的素材放在当前显示的页面上——图层的菜单设置它所在的页面。调整、裁剪和旋转按页设置关键帧，如同视频按帧。导出时每页写成一个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
