            "value" : "斜体（⌘I）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %@ pages are saved as a file each, numbered after the name: Name-1, Name-2, …" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "它的 %@ 个页面各存为一个文件，在名称后编号：名称-1、名称-2……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its assets stay in the project when the folder is deleted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "删除文件夹后，其中的素材仍保留在项目中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its first result makes the project a still or a timeline. Or set it up now:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "第一个生成结果决定项目是静态还是时间线。也可以现在设置："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its gain: 0 dB as it is, −6 dB half the level, up to +12 dB" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "增益：0 dB 为原样，−6 dB 为一半电平，最高 +12 dB"
