    "New pictures and markup are made on the selected layer. ⌘-click a second layer to merge the two. Drag a layer into the prompt to edit it alone; drag the picture on the stage, with every layer shown, to edit the whole." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "新图片和标注会生成在所选图层上。按住 ⌘ 点按第二个图层可合并两者。将图层拖入提示框可单独编辑它；显示所有图层时，拖动舞台上的图片可编辑整体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New pictures and markup are made on the selected layer; an asset dropped on the stage goes on a new layer. ⌘-click a second layer to merge the two. A layer showing a composition decomposes from its menu. Drag a layer into the prompt to edit it alone; drag the picture on the stage, with every layer shown, to edit the whole." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "新图片和标注会生成在所选图层上；拖到舞台上的素材会放到新图层上。按住 ⌘ 点按第二个图层可合并两者。显示合成的图层可从其菜单中分解。将图层拖入提示词可单独编辑它；将舞台上的图片（显示所有图层）拖入可编辑整体。"
          }
        }
