    "TaoMate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "TaoMate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TaoMate runs in its place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "由 TaoMate 代替它运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TaoMate-H3's streaming method, not a LoRA: the base model writes the soundtrack, then its adapter writes the video in chunks, 3 steps each, against a cache of the chunks before. It takes a LoRA slot in place of the Turbo LoRA. Words to a clip only, made in whole 5-second requests. That cache is kept on disk (in 8 bits with int8 GEMM) and read back a block at a time. An alternative to the Turbo LoRA: no Favor preset turns it on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "TaoMate-H3 的流式方法，而不是 LoRA：先由基础模型写出音轨，再由它的适配器分块写出视频，每块 3 步，并参照之前各块的缓存。它占用一个 LoRA 槽位，取代 Turbo LoRA。只能从文字生成片段，并以完整的 5 秒为单位生成。这份缓存存放在磁盘上（开启 int8 GEMM 时为 8 位），每次读回一个块。它是 Turbo LoRA 之外的另一种方法：没有哪个“偏好”预设会启用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "色温"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "温度 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text does not go on the stage: put it in the prompt." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "文本不能放到舞台上：请放入提示词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text to image" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "文生图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text to video" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "文生视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU is busy but running below the clock it is rated for — steps take longer, and nothing in the generation is at fault. Better airflow under the Mac helps more than anything in software." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 正忙，但运行频率低于其额定频率——每一步耗时更长，这并非生成过程的问题。改善 Mac 底部的通风比任何软件设置都更有帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU is idle, so its clock says nothing about throttling; showing the system thermal state instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 处于空闲，其频率无法说明是否降频；改为显示系统的热状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU is running at its full clock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 正以全频运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU's utilization, all apps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 利用率（所有应用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Neural Engine, estimated from its power where the counter is live, else from how long its fabric sat above idle" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "神经网络引擎：在功耗计数可用时据功耗估算，否则据其总线高于空闲状态的时间估算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clip is trimmed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "视频已修剪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The colour lines, outlines, text and the brush draw with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "直线、轮廓、文字和画笔所用的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file as it is, nothing re-encoded" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
