    "Your access token is used for this download only. Valtz sends it to Hugging Face with the download's requests and does not store it anywhere — not on disk, not in its settings, not in the log — so you paste it again for the next gated model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "你的访问令牌仅用于本次下载。Valtz 只在下载请求中将其发送给 Hugging Face，不会在任何地方保存它——不写入磁盘、不存入设置、不记入日志——因此下载下一个受限模型时需要再次粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your changes since it was saved will be lost, and can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
